<div class="MainBox ARIARoleMain">
<h1>Directory sync and self service</h1>
[% IF Data.Message %]<div class="MessageBox Error" role="alert"><p>[% Data.Message | html %]</p></div>[% END %]
[% UNLESS Data.RoutingReady %]<div class="MessageBox Notice"><p>Before importing users, configure Customer::AuthModule as Kernel::System::CustomerAuth::TESSERAIdentity and remove additional customer auth backends. Existing external provider configuration remains administrator-owned.</p></div>[% END %]
<p>Preferences provide request defaults only. SupportAssignments are managed manually or through approved external membership rules.</p>
<form action="[% Env('CGIHandle') | html %]" method="post" class="Validate PreventMultipleSubmits">
<input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentTESSERADirectorySync"/><input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="Save"/><input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Env('ChallengeToken') | html %]"/>
<fieldset class="TableLike"><legend>Directory and schedule</legend>
[% FOREACH Input IN Data.Inputs %]
<label for="[% Input.Name | html %]">[% Input.Label | html %]</label><div class="Field"><input id="[% Input.Name | html %]" name="[% Input.Name | html %]" value="[% Input.Value | html %]" maxlength="4000" required class="W50pc"/></div><div class="Clear"></div>
[% END %]
<label for="Password">Bind password</label><div class="Field"><input id="Password" name="Password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" maxlength="4096"/><p>[% IF Data.State.PasswordSet %]A password is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it.[% ELSE %]Requires the external ad-sync-key encryption key before saving.[% END %]</p></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<label for="Provider">Authentication provider</label><div class="Field"><select id="Provider" name="Provider"><option value="LDAP">Active Directory (LDAP with verified StartTLS)</option><option value="OpenIDConnect" [% IF Data.State.Config.Provider == 'OpenIDConnect' %]selected[% END %]>Configured OpenID Connect SSO</option></select></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<label for="LoginAttribute">Login identity attribute</label><div class="Field"><select id="LoginAttribute" name="LoginAttribute"><option value="sAMAccountName">sAMAccountName</option><option value="userPrincipalName" [% IF Data.State.Config.LoginAttribute == 'userPrincipalName' %]selected[% END %]>userPrincipalName</option></select></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<label for="RoleID">Default assignment role</label><div class="Field"><select id="RoleID" name="RoleID" required><option value="">Select a SUPPORT classification</option>[% FOREACH Role IN Data.Roles %]<option value="[% Role.ID | html %]" [% IF Data.State.Config.RoleID == Role.ID %]selected[% END %]>[% Role.Name | html %]</option>[% END %]</select></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<div class="Field"><label><input type="checkbox" name="Enabled" value="1" [% IF Data.State.Config.Enabled %]checked[% END %]/> Enable scheduled sync (daily by default)</label></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<div class="Field"><label><input type="checkbox" name="AutoCreateProfiles" value="1" [% IF Data.State.Config.AutoCreateProfiles %]checked[% END %]/> Automatically create SupportProfiles for unmapped groups matching the filter</label></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<div class="Field"><label><input type="checkbox" name="SyncAssignments" value="1" [% IF Data.State.Config.SyncAssignments OR !Data.State.PasswordSet %]checked[% END %]/> Synchronize source-owned SupportAssignments from external membership</label></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<div class="Field"><label><input type="checkbox" name="Nested" value="1" [% IF Data.State.Config.Nested %]checked[% END %]/> Include nested AD group membership</label></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<label for="ResponsibilityText">First-login license / responsibility text</label><div class="Field"><textarea id="ResponsibilityText" name="ResponsibilityText" rows="6" maxlength="20000" required class="W50pc">[% Data.State.Config.ResponsibilityText | html %]</textarea><p>Changing this text requires renewed acceptance. Provide your approved organization text.</p></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<label for="Script">TESSERA sync script</label><div class="Field"><textarea id="Script" name="Script" rows="14" maxlength="100000" required class="W75pc">[% Data.State.Script | html %]</textarea><p>Trusted operation: Directory / SyncMembership. Optional WITH keys: GroupNameContains, AutoCreateProfiles. Filtered runs never retire missing memberships.</p></div><div class="Clear"></div>
<div class="Field SpacingTop"><button type="submit" class="CallForAction Primary"><span>Save configuration</span></button></div><div class="Clear"></div>
</fieldset></form>
<h2>Discover and synchronize</h2><p>Sync now submits a daemon task. Refresh this page to see the last completed report; check the daemon log if a task fails.</p>
[% IF Data.State.LastFailure %]<div class="MessageBox Error" role="alert"><p>The latest background sync failed. The report below is the last successful run. Check source configuration and restricted daemon diagnostics before retrying.</p></div>[% END %]
[% FOREACH Operation IN ['Discover','Sync'] %]<form action="[% Env('CGIHandle') | html %]" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentTESSERADirectorySync"/><input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="[% Operation | html %]"/><input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Env('ChallengeToken') | html %]"/><button type="submit" class="CallForAction"><span>[% IF Operation == 'Discover' %]Retrieve filtered AD groups[% ELSE %]Run TESSERA sync script now[% END %]</span></button></form>[% END %]
[% IF Data.State.Report %]<p role="status">Last sync: [% Data.State.Report.Processed | html %] users processed; [% Data.State.Report.CreatedAssignments | html %] assignments created; [% Data.State.Report.RetiredAssignments | html %] source-owned assignments retired; [% Data.State.Report.Unmapped.size | html %] unmapped groups awaiting selection.</p>[% END %]
<h2>Group mappings</h2><p>Map an existing SupportProfile, create one for an unmapped group, or enable automatic creation above. External assignment sync is the default for new mappings. A manual mapping imports users without maintaining assignments.</p>
[% FOREACH Group IN Data.State.Groups %]
[% Mapping = Data.State.Mappings.item(Group.GUID) %]
<section class="WidgetSimple"><div class="Header"><h3>[% Group.Name | html %]</h3></div><div class="Content"><p>[% Group.DN | html %]</p>
<form action="[% Env('CGIHandle') | html %]" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="Action" value="AgentTESSERADirectorySync"/><input type="hidden" name="Subaction" value="Map"/><input type="hidden" name="ChallengeToken" value="[% Env('ChallengeToken') | html %]"/><input type="hidden" name="GUID" value="[% Group.GUID | html %]"/>
<label for="Profile-[% Group.GUID | html %]">SupportProfile</label><select id="Profile-[% Group.GUID | html %]" name="ProfileID"><option value="">Select an existing SupportProfile</option>[% FOREACH Profile IN Data.Profiles %]<option value="[% Profile.ID | html %]" [% IF Mapping.ProfileID == Profile.ID %]selected[% END %]>[% Profile.Name | html %]</option>[% END %]</select>
<label for="Role-[% Group.GUID | html %]">Role</label><select id="Role-[% Group.GUID | html %]" name="RoleID" required>[% FOREACH Role IN Data.Roles %]<option value="[% Role.ID | html %]" [% IF Mapping.RoleID == Role.ID OR (!Mapping AND Data.State.Config.RoleID == Role.ID) %]selected[% END %]>[% Role.Name | html %]</option>[% END %]</select>
<label for="Mode-[% Group.GUID | html %]">Assignments</label><select id="Mode-[% Group.GUID | html %]" name="Mode"><option value="External">External membership sync</option><option value="Manual" [% IF Mapping.Mode == 'Manual' %]selected[% END %]>Manual assignment management</option></select>
<button type="submit" class="CallForAction"><span>Save mapping</span></button>[% UNLESS Mapping %]<button type="submit" name="Create" value="1" class="CallForAction"><span>Create SupportProfile and map</span></button>[% END %]
</form></div></section>
[% END %]
</div>
